#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/hydrosphere.md:1
msgid "Hydrosphere Theory"
msgstr "水圈过程理论"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/hydrosphere.md:3
msgid "Scope, process inventory, and certificate map"
msgstr "范围、过程清单与证书映射"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/hydrosphere.md:5
msgid "The RELIC hydrosphere domain (`relic.scientific.hydrosphere`) governs land-surface evapotranspiration, snowpack mass-energy balance and snow-aging albedo, van Genuchten soil-water retention, single-bucket and vertical Richards vadose-zone moisture dynamics, infiltration- and saturation-excess surface runoff, hybrid event-triggered Hortonian surface ponding, subsurface lateral stormflow, vadose-aquifer percolation and capillary exchange, and unconfined groundwater storage (*Methods of Ecological Analysis*, Chapter 19)."
msgstr "RELIC 水圈领域（`relic.scientific.hydrosphere`）控制陆面蒸散发（Evapotranspiration, ET）、积雪质量-能量平衡与雪老化反照率、van Genuchten 土壤持水特征、单桶与垂向 Richards 包气带水分动力学、超渗与蓄满地表径流、混杂事件触发的霍顿（Hortonian）地表积水、壤中侧向暴雨流、包气带-含水层深层渗漏与毛细交换以及潜水含水层蓄量（《生态学分析方法》，第 19 章）。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/hydrosphere.md:13
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Fourteen concrete scientific Functors reside in `relic.scientific.hydrosphere`, each paired with an `IPHSEquivalenceCertificate` spanning `Level 1` through `Level 3` (`2` at `Level 1`, `2` at `Level 2`, and `10` at `Level 3`). A related vadose-zone solver, {ref}`SoilWaterTransportFunctor <class-relic-scientific-pedosphere-transport-soilwatertransportfunctor-soilwatertransportfunctor>` (`Level 3`), resides in `relic.scientific.pedosphere.transport` and is contrasted below to enforce single-writer `soil_moisture` governance."
msgstr "`relic.scientific.hydrosphere` 包含 14 个具体科学算子，每个算子均配有一份跨 `Level 1` 至 `Level 3` 的 `IPHSEquivalenceCertificate` 证书（`Level 1` 共 `2` 个，`Level 2` 共 `2` 个，`Level 3` 共 `10` 个）。另一相关的包气带求解器 {ref}`SoilWaterTransportFunctor <class-relic-scientific-pedosphere-transport-soilwatertransportfunctor-soilwatertransportfunctor>`（`Level 3`）位于 `relic.scientific.pedosphere.transport` 中，下文将其并列对比以阐明 `soil_moisture` 单一写入者治理契约。"

