msgid "Penman-Monteith combination equation"
msgstr "Penman-Monteith 联合方程"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/hydrosphere.md:46
msgid "`relic.scientific.hydrosphere.evapotranspiration.penman_monteith.PenmanMonteithET` (`Level 3`) combines surface energy balance with aerodynamic and surface-resistance vapor transfer (Monteith, 1965; Allen et al., 1998). With available radiative energy $A_e = R_n - G$ [W m$^{-2}$], saturation vapor-pressure slope $\\Delta = \\frac{\\mathrm{d}e_s}{\\mathrm{d}T}(T_a)$ [Pa K$^{-1}$], psychrometric constant $\\gamma = \\frac{c_p P}{\\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{mw}}\\lambda_v}$, vapor pressure deficit $D = \\max(e_s(T_a) - e_a, 0)$ [Pa], aerodynamic resistance $r_a$, and bulk surface resistance $r_s$, latent heat flux $\\lambda_v E$ [W m$^{-2}$] and mass evapotranspiration flux $E_{\\mathrm{ET}}$ [kg m$^{-2}$ s$^{-1}$] satisfy"
msgstr "`relic.scientific.hydrosphere.evapotranspiration.penman_monteith.PenmanMonteithET`（`Level 3`）联立地表能量平衡与空气动力学及地表阻力水汽传输（Monteith, 1965；Allen et al., 1998）。给定可用辐射能 $A_e = R_n - G$ [W m$^{-2}$]、饱和水汽压斜率 $\\Delta = \\frac{\\mathrm{d}e_s}{\\mathrm{d}T}(T_a)$ [Pa K$^{-1}$]、干湿表常数 $\\gamma = \\frac{c_p P}{\\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{mw}}\\lambda_v}$、饱和水汽压差 $D = \\max(e_s(T_a) - e_a, 0)$ [Pa]、空气动力学阻力 $r_a$ 以及整体地表阻力 $r_s$，潜热通量 $\\lambda_v E$ [W m$^{-2}$] 与蒸散发质量通量 $E_{\\mathrm{ET}}$ [kg m$^{-2}$ s$^{-1}$] 满足"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/hydrosphere.md:57
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\lambda_v E = \\frac{\\Delta(R_n - G) + \\rho_a c_p D / r_a}{\\Delta + \\gamma\\left(1 + r_s / r_a\\right)},\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"E_{\\mathrm{ET}} = \\frac{\\lambda_v E}{\\lambda_v}.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\\lambda_v E = \\frac{\\Delta(R_n - G) + \\rho_a c_p D / r_a}{\\Delta + \\gamma\\left(1 + r_s / r_a\\right)},\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"E_{\\mathrm{ET}} = \\frac{\\lambda_v E}{\\lambda_v}.\n"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/hydrosphere.md:63
msgid "Canopy interception evaporation, plant transpiration, and bare-soil evaporation are partitioned consistently with canopy cover fraction and root-zone moisture availability without mutating soil water directly."
msgstr "冠层截留蒸发、植物蒸腾与裸土蒸发按冠层覆盖度及根区水分可利用性一致分配，且不直接修改土壤水分存量。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/hydrosphere.md:67
msgid "Priestley-Taylor equilibrium-radiation closure"
msgstr "Priestley-Taylor 平衡辐射闭合"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/hydrosphere.md:69
msgid "`relic.scientific.hydrosphere.evapotranspiration.priestley_taylor.PriestleyTaylorET` (`Level 3`) evaluates equilibrium evaporation scaled by the Priestley and Taylor (1972) advection coefficient $\\alpha_{\\mathrm{PT}}$ (typically $1.26$ for well-watered surfaces) and soil-moisture stress scalar $\\beta_W \\in [0, 1]$:"
msgstr "`relic.scientific.hydrosphere.evapotranspiration.priestley_taylor.PriestleyTaylorET`（`Level 3`）计算经 Priestley and Taylor（1972）平流系数 $\\alpha_{\\mathrm{PT}}$（水分充足下垫面典型值为 $1.26$）与土壤水分胁迫标量 $\\beta_W \\in [0, 1]$ 缩放的平衡蒸发："

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/hydrosphere.md:74
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\lambda_v E_{\\mathrm{pot}} = \\alpha_{\\mathrm{PT}}\\,\\frac{\\Delta}{\\Delta + \\gamma}\\,(R_n - G),\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"E_{\\mathrm{ET}} = \\beta_W\\,\\frac{\\max(\\lambda_v E_{\\mathrm{pot}}, 0)}{\\lambda_v}.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\\lambda_v E_{\\mathrm{pot}} = \\alpha_{\\mathrm{PT}}\\,\\frac{\\Delta}{\\Delta + \\gamma}\\,(R_n - G),\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"E_{\\mathrm{ET}} = \\beta_W\\,\\frac{\\max(\\lambda_v E_{\\mathrm{pot}}, 0)}{\\lambda_v}.\n"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/hydrosphere.md:80
msgid "In any composed simulation graph, either `PenmanMonteithET` or `PriestleyTaylorET` is selected as the sole writer of `evapotranspiration_flux`."
msgstr "在任意组合模拟图中，`PenmanMonteithET` 与 `PriestleyTaylorET` 二者择一作为 `evapotranspiration_flux` 的唯一写入者。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/hydrosphere.md:83
msgid "Snowpack mass-energy balance and snow albedo"
msgstr "积雪质量-能量平衡与积雪反照率"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/hydrosphere.md:85
msgid "`relic.scientific.hydrosphere.snow.snowpack.SnowPack` (`Level 3`) maintains a coupled mass-and-cold-content ledger for snow water equivalent $W_{\\mathrm{snow}}$ [kg m$^{-2}$] and snow internal thermal state (Anderson, 1976; Tarboton and Luce, 1996). Total precipitation $P$ is partitioned by wet-bulb or air temperature thresholds into snowfall $P_{\\mathrm{snow}}$ and liquid rain $P_{\\mathrm{rain}}$ ($P = P_{\\mathrm{snow}} + P_{\\mathrm{rain}}$). Given net snowpack heat input $Q_{\\mathrm{net}}$ [W m$^{-2}$] and latent heat of fusion $L_f$ (`get_physical_constant(\"latent_heat_fusion\")`), potential melt $M_{\\mathrm{pot}} = \\max(Q_{\\mathrm{net}}, 0)/L_f$ is bounded by available solid storage and liquid-water holding capacity, satisfying the exact per-step mass ledger"
msgstr "`relic.scientific.hydrosphere.snow.snowpack.SnowPack`（`Level 3`）维护雪水当量 $W_{\\mathrm{snow}}$ [kg m$^{-2}$] 与积雪内部热状态的耦合质量-冷含量账本（Anderson, 1976；Tarboton and Luce, 1996）。总降水 $P$ 按湿球温度或气温阈值划分为降雪 $P_{\\mathrm{snow}}$ 与液态降雨 $P_{\\mathrm{rain}}$（$P = P_{\\mathrm{snow}} + P_{\\mathrm{rain}}$）。给定净积雪热量输入 $Q_{\\mathrm{net}}$ [W m$^{-2}$] 与融化潜热 $L_f$（`get_physical_constant(\"latent_heat_fusion\")`），潜在融雪量 $M_{\\mathrm{pot}} = \\max(Q_{\\mathrm{net}}, 0)/L_f$ 受可用固态储雪量与液态水持留容量约束，满足精确单步质量账本"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/hydrosphere.md:97
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\Delta W_{\\mathrm{snow}} = \\left(P_{\\mathrm{snow}} + F_{\\mathrm{refreeze}} - M_{\\mathrm{snow}} - E_{\\mathrm{sub}}\\right)\\Delta t,\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\\Delta W_{\\mathrm{snow}} = \\left(P_{\\mathrm{snow}} + F_{\\mathrm{refreeze}} - M_{\\mathrm{snow}} - E_{\\mathrm{sub}}\\right)\\Delta t,\n"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/hydrosphere.md:101
msgid "where $\\Delta W_{\\mathrm{snow}}$ is committed via `UpdateItem(ACCUMULATE, per_timestep=True)` and `snow_melt_flux` ($M_{\\mathrm{snow}}$) and `rain_flux` ($P_{\\mathrm{rain}}$) are emitted as `REPLACE` boundary fluxes."
msgstr "其中 $\\Delta W_{\\mathrm{snow}}$ 通过 `UpdateItem(ACCUMULATE, per_timestep=True)` 提交，`snow_melt_flux`（$M_{\\mathrm{snow}}$）与 `rain_flux`（$P_{\\mathrm{rain}}$）作为 `REPLACE` 边界通量输出。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/hydrosphere.md:105
msgid "`relic.scientific.hydrosphere.snow.albedo.SnowAlbedo` (`Level 1`) is a read-only observation map computing broadband snow surface albedo $\\alpha_{\\mathrm{snow}} \\in [\\alpha_{\\min}, \\alpha_{\\max}]$ from snow age and near-freezing metamorphism decay rates without modifying `W_{\\mathrm{snow}}`."
msgstr "`relic.scientific.hydrosphere.snow.albedo.SnowAlbedo`（`Level 1`）为只读观测映射，依据雪龄与近冰点变质衰减速率计算宽波段积雪表面反照率 $\\alpha_{\\mathrm{snow}} \\in [\\alpha_{\\min}, \\alpha_{\\max}]$，且不改动 `W_{\\mathrm{snow}}`。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/hydrosphere.md:110
msgid "Soil-water retention, bucket storage, and Richards vadose flow"
msgstr "土壤持水特征、单桶蓄水与 Richards 包气带渗流"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/hydrosphere.md:112
msgid "van Genuchten retention observation (`SoilWaterRetention`, Level 1)"
msgstr "van Genuchten 持水特征观测（`SoilWaterRetention`，Level 1）"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/hydrosphere.md:114
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`relic.scientific.hydrosphere.soil_moisture.retention.SoilWaterRetention` (`Level 1`) evaluates the equilibrium van Genuchten (1980) constitutive curve mapping volumetric water content $\\theta$ [m$^3$ m$^{-3}$] to soil matric potential $\\psi$ [MPa] without advancing water storage:"
msgstr "`relic.scientific.hydrosphere.soil_moisture.retention.SoilWaterRetention`（`Level 1`）在不推进水分存量的前提下计算平衡态 van Genuchten（1980）本构曲线，将体积含水量 $\\theta$ [m$^3$ m$^{-3}$] 映射为土壤基质势 $\\psi$ [MPa]："

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/hydrosphere.md:119
msgid ""
"\n"
"S_e = \\operatorname{clip}\\!\\left(\\frac{\\theta - \\theta_r}{\\theta_s - \\theta_r},\\; S_{e,\\min},\\; 1\\right),\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"h(S_e) = -\\frac{1}{\\alpha_{\\mathrm{VG}}}\\left(S_e^{-1/m} - 1\\right)^{1/n},\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"m = 1 - \\frac{1}{n},\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"S_e = \\operatorname{clip}\\!\\left(\\frac{\\theta - \\theta_r}{\\theta_s - \\theta_r},\\; S_{e,\\min},\\; 1\\right),\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"h(S_e) = -\\frac{1}{\\alpha_{\\mathrm{VG}}}\\left(S_e^{-1/m} - 1\\right)^{1/n},\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"m = 1 - \\frac{1}{n},\n"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/hydrosphere.md:127
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\psi = 10^{-6}\\,\\rho_w g\\,h(S_e) \\le 0\\quad [\\mathrm{MPa}].\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\\psi = 10^{-6}\\,\\rho_w g\\,h(S_e) \\le 0\\quad [\\mathrm{MPa}].\n"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/hydrosphere.md:131
msgid "`soil_water_potential` is emitted via `REPLACE` for downstream plant-water-stress and stomatal consumers."
msgstr "`soil_water_potential` 通过 `REPLACE` 输出，供下游植物水分胁迫与气孔过程消费。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/hydrosphere.md:134
msgid "Root-zone bucket closure and 1D Richards unsaturated flow"
msgstr "根区单桶闭合与一维 Richards 非饱和渗流"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/hydrosphere.md:136
msgid "`relic.scientific.hydrosphere.soil_moisture.bucket.BucketSoilMoisture` (`Level 3`) evolves single-layer root-zone storage $S_w = \\rho_w Z_r \\theta$ [kg m$^{-2}$] under infiltration $I$, evapotranspiration extraction $E_{\\mathrm{ET}}$, gravity drainage $Q_{\\mathrm{drain}}(\\theta)$, and saturation capacity $S_{w,\\max} = \\rho_w Z_r \\theta_s$ (Manabe, 1969):"
msgstr "`relic.scientific.hydrosphere.soil_moisture.bucket.BucketSoilMoisture`（`Level 3`）在入渗 $I$、蒸散发抽吸 $E_{\\mathrm{ET}}$、重力排水 $Q_{\\mathrm{drain}}(\\theta)$ 与饱和容量 $S_{w,\\max} = \\rho_w Z_r \\theta_s$ 下演化单层根区蓄水量 $S_w = \\rho_w Z_r \\theta$ [kg m$^{-2}$]（Manabe, 1969）："

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/hydrosphere.md:142
msgid ""
"\n"
"S_{w,\\mathrm{raw}} = S_w + \\left(I - E_{\\mathrm{ET}} - Q_{\\mathrm{drain}}\\right)\\Delta t,\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"Q_{\\mathrm{sat,ex}} = \\frac{\\max(S_{w,\\mathrm{raw}} - S_{w,\\max},\\; 0)}{\\Delta t},\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"S_{w,\\mathrm{raw}} = S_w + \\left(I - E_{\\mathrm{ET}} - Q_{\\mathrm{drain}}\\right)\\Delta t,\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"Q_{\\mathrm{sat,ex}} = \\frac{\\max(S_{w,\\mathrm{raw}} - S_{w,\\max},\\; 0)}{\\Delta t},\n"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/hydrosphere.md:148
msgid "so accepted storage increment $\\Delta S_w$, drainage, and saturation-excess overflow close to machine precision: $\\Delta S_w - (I - E_{\\mathrm{ET}} - Q_{\\mathrm{drain}} - Q_{\\mathrm{sat,ex}})\\Delta t = 0$."
msgstr "从而使已接受蓄水增量 $\\Delta S_w$、排水与蓄满溢流在机器精度内严格闭合：$\\Delta S_w - (I - E_{\\mathrm{ET}} - Q_{\\mathrm{drain}} - Q_{\\mathrm{sat,ex}})\\Delta t = 0$。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/hydrosphere.md:152
msgid "`relic.scientific.hydrosphere.soil_moisture.richards.RichardsSoilMoisture` (`Level 3`) solves the multi-layer vertical mixed-form Richards equation (Richards, 1931; Celia et al., 1990) with Mualem-van Genuchten unsaturated hydraulic conductivity $K(S_e) = K_{\\mathrm{sat}} S_e^{\\ell}\\left[1 - (1 - S_e^{1/m})^m\\right]^2$:"
msgstr "`relic.scientific.hydrosphere.soil_moisture.richards.RichardsSoilMoisture`（`Level 3`）采用 Mualem-van Genuchten 非饱和导水率 $K(S_e) = K_{\\mathrm{sat}} S_e^{\\ell}\\left[1 - (1 - S_e^{1/m})^m\\right]^2$ 求解多层垂向混合形式 Richards 方程（Richards, 1931；Celia et al., 1990）："

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/hydrosphere.md:157
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\frac{\\partial \\theta}{\\partial t} = -\\frac{\\partial q_z}{\\partial z} - s_{\\mathrm{root}}(z),\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"q_z = -K(\\theta)\\left(\\frac{\\partial h(\\theta)}{\\partial z} + 1\\right),\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\\frac{\\partial \\theta}{\\partial t} = -\\frac{\\partial q_z}{\\partial z} - s_{\\mathrm{root}}(z),\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"q_z = -K(\\theta)\\left(\\frac{\\partial h(\\theta)}{\\partial z} + 1\\right),\n"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/hydrosphere.md:163
msgid "in discrete cochain form $\\dot{\\boldsymbol{\\theta}}_h = -D_h \\mathbf{q}_h + G_h \\mathbf{u}_h$ with symmetric positive-semidefinite face-conductance operator $\\star_K = \\star_K^{\\mathsf{T}} \\succeq 0$."
msgstr "其离散上链形式为 $\\dot{\\boldsymbol{\\theta}}_h = -D_h \\mathbf{q}_h + G_h \\mathbf{u}_h$，配以对称半正定面导度算子 $\\star_K = \\star_K^{\\mathsf{T}} \\succeq 0$。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/hydrosphere.md:167
msgid "**Single-writer ownership rule**: `BucketSoilMoisture`, `RichardsSoilMoisture`, and pedosphere `relic.scientific.pedosphere.transport.SoilWaterTransportFunctor.SoilWaterTransportFunctor` (`Level 3`, which emits full next-state `soil_moisture` via `REPLACE`) are mutually exclusive owners of volumetric soil moisture. A valid simulator graph registers at most one soil-moisture state writer and routes cross-sphere fluxes through `PedosphereInterfaceMapper`."
msgstr "**单一写入者归属规则**：`BucketSoilMoisture`、`RichardsSoilMoisture` 与土壤圈 `relic.scientific.pedosphere.transport.SoilWaterTransportFunctor.SoilWaterTransportFunctor`（`Level 3`，通过 `REPLACE` 输出完整下一时刻 `soil_moisture`）对体积土壤含水量具有互斥归属权。合法的模拟器计算图至多注册一个土壤水分状态写入者，并通过 `PedosphereInterfaceMapper` 路由跨圈层通量。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/hydrosphere.md:175
msgid "Surface runoff and hybrid event-driven Hortonian ponding"
msgstr "地表径流与混杂事件驱动的霍顿积水"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/hydrosphere.md:177
msgid "Surface runoff partitioning and liquid-input modes"
msgstr "地表径流分配与液态水输入模式"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/hydrosphere.md:179
msgid "`relic.scientific.hydrosphere.runoff.surface.SurfaceRunoff` (`Level 3`) partitions liquid surface water input rate $P_{\\mathrm{in}}$ [kg m$^{-2}$ s$^{-1}$] into overland runoff $Q_{\\mathrm{surf}}$ and soil infiltration $I$ satisfying exact flux conservation:"
msgstr "`relic.scientific.hydrosphere.runoff.surface.SurfaceRunoff`（`Level 3`）将地表液态水输入速率 $P_{\\mathrm{in}}$ [kg m$^{-2}$ s$^{-1}$] 划分为坡面径流 $Q_{\\mathrm{surf}}$ 与土壤入渗 $I$，满足精确通量守恒："

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/hydrosphere.md:184
msgid ""
"\n"
"P_{\\mathrm{in}} = Q_{\\mathrm{surf}} + I,\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"Q_{\\mathrm{surf}} \\ge 0,\\quad I \\ge 0.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"P_{\\mathrm{in}} = Q_{\\mathrm{surf}} + I,\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"Q_{\\mathrm{surf}} \\ge 0,\\quad I \\ge 0.\n"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/hydrosphere.md:190
msgid "To prevent snowpack double counting when coupled with `SnowPack`, `SurfaceRunoff` requires an explicit `surface_water_input_source` selection:"
msgstr "为防止与 `SnowPack` 耦合时对积雪水量重复计入，`SurfaceRunoff` 要求显式选择 `surface_water_input_source`："

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/hydrosphere.md:193
msgid "`\"precipitation_flux\"`: snow-free mode reading total `precipitation_flux` ($P_{\\mathrm{in}} = P$);"
msgstr "`\"precipitation_flux\"`：无雪模式，读取总降水通量 `precipitation_flux`（$P_{\\mathrm{in}} = P$）；"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/hydrosphere.md:195
msgid "`\"rain_flux_plus_snow_melt_flux\"`: snow-coupled mode reading liquid throughfall plus snowmelt ($P_{\\mathrm{in}} = P_{\\mathrm{rain}} + M_{\\mathrm{snow}}$)."
msgstr "`\"rain_flux_plus_snow_melt_flux\"`：积雪耦合模式，读取液态降雨加融雪通量（$P_{\\mathrm{in}} = P_{\\mathrm{rain}} + M_{\\mathrm{snow}}$）。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/hydrosphere.md:198
msgid "Supported constitutive partitioning closures include USDA-SCS Curve Number event abstraction, Hortonian infiltration-capacity excess $Q_{\\mathrm{surf}} = \\max(P_{\\mathrm{in}} - f_c(\\theta), 0)$, Dunne saturation-excess runoff over variable contributing area $f_{\\mathrm{sat}}(\\theta)$, and combined infiltration- plus saturation-excess routing."
msgstr "受支持的本构产流闭合格式包括美国农业部水土保持局（USDA-SCS）曲线数事件初损抽象、霍顿超渗产流 $Q_{\\mathrm{surf}} = \\max(P_{\\mathrm{in}} - f_c(\\theta), 0)$、可变产流面积 $f_{\\mathrm{sat}}(\\theta)$ 上的 Dunne 蓄满产流，以及超渗加蓄满联合产流。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/hydrosphere.md:204
msgid "Hybrid Hortonian ponding event detection and overland recession"
msgstr "混杂霍顿积水事件检测与坡面退水"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/hydrosphere.md:206
msgid "When transient storm-scale ponding topology transitions are resolved explicitly (for example alongside `MarkedPoissonRainfallFunctor`), RELIC pairs two `Level 2` Functors in `relic.scientific.hydrosphere.runoff.surface_ponding` (*Methods of Ecological Analysis*, Chapters 19 and 27):"
msgstr "当显式解析瞬态暴雨尺度积水拓扑跃迁时（如与 `MarkedPoissonRainfallFunctor` 联用），RELIC 在 `relic.scientific.hydrosphere.runoff.surface_ponding` 中配对使用两个 `Level 2` 算子（《生态学分析方法》，第 19 与 27 章）："

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/hydrosphere.md:211
#, python-brace-format
msgid "**Guard evaluation and topology intent (`HortonianPondingEventFunctor`, `Level 2`)**: Reads cumulative `stochastic_rainfall_depth` $H_n$ [mm] and its own replay-critical module extra state $H_{n-1}$ (persisted through PyTorch `get_extra_state` / `set_extra_state` for deterministic checkpoint/restart) to form the step rainfall depth increment $\\Delta H_n = H_n - H_{n-1}$ and Hortonian infiltration-excess depth"
msgstr "**守卫求值与拓扑意图（`HortonianPondingEventFunctor`，`Level 2`）**：读取累积随机雨深 `stochastic_rainfall_depth` $H_n$ [mm] 及其自身重放关键模块附加状态 $H_{n-1}$（通过 PyTorch `get_extra_state` / `set_extra_state` 持久化以保证确定性检查点/重启），构造单步雨深增量 $\\Delta H_n = H_n - H_{n-1}$ 与霍顿超渗水深"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/hydrosphere.md:218
#, python-brace-format
msgid "E_n = \\max\\!\\left(0,\\; \\Delta H_n - I_{\\max}\\,\\frac{\\Delta t}{3600}\\right)\\quad [\\mathrm{mm}],"
msgstr "E_n = \\max\\!\\left(0,\\; \\Delta H_n - I_{\\max}\\,\\frac{\\Delta t}{3600}\\right)\\quad [\\mathrm{mm}],"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/hydrosphere.md:220
msgid "where $I_{\\max}$ [mm hr$^{-1}$] is maximum infiltration capacity. Given active ponding indicator $a \\in \\{0, 1\\}$ and current ponded depth $h_n$ [mm], hysteretic threshold guards ($E_{\\mathrm{on}} > 0$, $h_{\\mathrm{off}} \\ge 0$) emit typed `relic.core.state.types.ExternalIntent` topology requests (`\"ponding_onset\"` when $a = 0$ and $\\max E_n \\ge E_{\\mathrm{on}}$; `\"ponding_cessation\"` when $a = 1$, $\\max E_n = 0$, and $\\max h_n \\le h_{\\mathrm{off}}$), which the simulator commits between steps via `Simulator.apply_topology_transition`."
msgstr "其中 $I_{\\max}$ [mm hr$^{-1}$] 为最大入渗能力。给定活跃积水指示量 $a \\in \\{0, 1\\}$ 与当前积水深度 $h_n$ [mm]，滞回阈值守卫（$E_{\\mathrm{on}} > 0$，$h_{\\mathrm{off}} \\ge 0$）发出带类型的 `relic.core.state.types.ExternalIntent` 拓扑请求（当 $a = 0$ 且 $\\max E_n \\ge E_{\\mathrm{on}}$ 时发出 `\"ponding_onset\"`；当 $a = 1$、$\\max E_n = 0$ 且 $\\max h_n \\le h_{\\mathrm{off}}$ 时发出 `\"ponding_cessation\"`），由模拟器在步间经 `Simulator.apply_topology_transition` 提交。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/hydrosphere.md:228
msgid "**Exact linear-reservoir ponding evolution (`SurfacePondingFunctor`, `Level 2`)**: Advances surface ponded water depth $h_n$ [mm] over recession timescale $\\tau > 0$ [s] via the exact analytical exponential sub-flow:"
msgstr "**精确线性水库积水演化（`SurfacePondingFunctor`，`Level 2`）**：在退水时间尺度 $\\tau > 0$ [s] 上按精确解析指数子流推进地表积水深度 $h_n$ [mm]："

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/hydrosphere.md:232
#, python-brace-format
msgid "h_{n+1} = (h_n + E_n)\\exp\\!\\left(-\\frac{\\Delta t}{\\tau}\\right), \\qquad q_n = (h_n + E_n) - h_{n+1},"
msgstr "h_{n+1} = (h_n + E_n)\\exp\\!\\left(-\\frac{\\Delta t}{\\tau}\\right), \\qquad q_n = (h_n + E_n) - h_{n+1},"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/hydrosphere.md:234
#, python-brace-format
msgid "emitting $\\Delta h_n = h_{n+1} - h_n$ via `UpdateItem(ACCUMULATE, per_timestep=True)` and step runoff depth $q_n$ / rate $q_n / \\Delta t$ via `REPLACE`. By construction, the step ponding mass-balance residual $(h_{n+1} - h_n) - E_n + q_n = 0$ vanishes to floating-point roundoff for every $\\Delta t > 0$."
msgstr "通过 `UpdateItem(ACCUMULATE, per_timestep=True)` 输出 $\\Delta h_n = h_{n+1} - h_n$，并通过 `REPLACE` 输出单步径流水深 $q_n$ 与径流速率 $q_n / \\Delta t$。由构造方式可知，对任意 $\\Delta t > 0$，单步积水质量平衡残差 $(h_{n+1} - h_n) - E_n + q_n = 0$ 在浮点舍入精度内恒为零。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/hydrosphere.md:240
msgid "Subsurface stormflow, vadose-aquifer exchange, and groundwater"
msgstr "壤中暴雨流、包气带-含水层交换与地下水"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/hydrosphere.md:242
msgid "**Subsurface lateral stormflow (`SubsurfaceRunoff`, `Level 3`)**: `relic.scientific.hydrosphere.runoff.subsurface.SubsurfaceRunoff` computes topographic-slope lateral interflow above low-permeability horizons as a monotone function of drainable water above field capacity, $Q_{\\mathrm{sub}} = k_{\\mathrm{sub}}\\,\\tan\\beta_{\\mathrm{topo}}\\,\\max(\\theta - \\theta_{\\mathrm{fc}}, 0)^b$ (Beven and Kirkby, 1979)."
msgstr "**壤中侧向暴雨流（`SubsurfaceRunoff`，`Level 3`）**：`relic.scientific.hydrosphere.runoff.subsurface.SubsurfaceRunoff` 将低渗透层上方的地形坡度侧向壤中流计算为田间持水量以上可排水量的单调函数 $Q_{\\mathrm{sub}} = k_{\\mathrm{sub}}\\,\\tan\\beta_{\\mathrm{topo}}\\,\\max(\\theta - \\theta_{\\mathrm{fc}}, 0)^b$（Beven and Kirkby, 1979）。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/hydrosphere.md:249
msgid "**Vertical percolation (`VerticalPercolationTransport`, `Level 3`) and capillary rise (`CapillaryRiseTransport`, `Level 3`)**: `VerticalPercolationTransport` routes gravity-driven free drainage $Q_{\\mathrm{perc}} = K(\\theta)$ downward from the bottom vadose layer into groundwater recharge (`ACCUMULATE` storage transfer, conserving total vadose-plus-aquifer water mass). Conversely, `CapillaryRiseTransport` routes upward matric-suction flux from a shallow water table $z_{\\mathrm{wt}}$ into an unsaturated root zone when $\\psi(\\theta_{\\mathrm{bot}})$ lies below hydrostatic equilibrium, bounded strictly by available aquifer storage and receiving pore capacity."
msgstr "**垂向深层渗漏（`VerticalPercolationTransport`，`Level 3`）与毛细上升（`CapillaryRiseTransport`，`Level 3`）**：`VerticalPercolationTransport` 将重力自由排水 $Q_{\\mathrm{perc}} = K(\\theta)$ 自包气带底层向下输送为地下水补给（采用 `ACCUMULATE` 存量转移，严格守恒包气带加含水层总水质量）。反之，当底层基质势 $\\psi(\\theta_{\\mathrm{bot}})$ 低于静水力平衡值时，`CapillaryRiseTransport` 将基质吸力驱动的上升水流通量自浅层潜水面 $z_{\\mathrm{wt}}$ 输送至非饱和根区，并严格受可用含水层蓄量与接收层孔隙容量约束。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/hydrosphere.md:259
msgid "**Unconfined aquifer dynamics (`GroundwaterDynamics`, `Level 3`)**: `relic.scientific.hydrosphere.groundwater.dynamics.GroundwaterDynamics` advances unconfined aquifer water storage $S_{\\mathrm{gw}}$ [kg m$^{-2}$] and water-table depth $z_{\\mathrm{wt}}$ with specific yield $S_y$ and linear or nonlinear baseflow recession $Q_{\\mathrm{base}}(S_{\\mathrm{gw}})$ (Niu et al., 2007):"
msgstr "**潜水含水层动力学（`GroundwaterDynamics`，`Level 3`）**：`relic.scientific.hydrosphere.groundwater.dynamics.GroundwaterDynamics` 采用给水度 $S_y$ 与线性或非线性基流退水函数 $Q_{\\mathrm{base}}(S_{\\mathrm{gw}})$ 推进潜水含水层蓄水量 $S_{\\mathrm{gw}}$ [kg m$^{-2}$] 与潜水面埋深 $z_{\\mathrm{wt}}$（Niu et al., 2007）："

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/hydrosphere.md:266
msgid "\\frac{\\mathrm{d}S_{\\mathrm{gw}}}{\\mathrm{d}t} = R_{\\mathrm{perc}} - C_{\\mathrm{cap}} - Q_{\\mathrm{base}}(S_{\\mathrm{gw}}) - Q_{\\mathrm{pump}}, \\qquad \\Delta z_{\\mathrm{wt}} = -\\frac{\\Delta S_{\\mathrm{gw}}}{\\rho_w S_y},"
msgstr "\\frac{\\mathrm{d}S_{\\mathrm{gw}}}{\\mathrm{d}t} = R_{\\mathrm{perc}} - C_{\\mathrm{cap}} - Q_{\\mathrm{base}}(S_{\\mathrm{gw}}) - Q_{\\mathrm{pump}}, \\qquad \\Delta z_{\\mathrm{wt}} = -\\frac{\\Delta S_{\\mathrm{gw}}}{\\rho_w S_y},"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/hydrosphere.md:268
msgid "closing the coupled subsurface hydrological ledger $\\Delta S_{\\mathrm{gw}} - (R_{\\mathrm{perc}} - C_{\\mathrm{cap}} - Q_{\\mathrm{base}} - Q_{\\mathrm{pump}})\\Delta t = 0$."
msgstr "使耦合地下水水文账本 $\\Delta S_{\\mathrm{gw}} - (R_{\\mathrm{perc}} - C_{\\mathrm{cap}} - Q_{\\mathrm{base}} - Q_{\\mathrm{pump}})\\Delta t = 0$ 严格闭合。"

